<view class="page">
  <view class="nav-bar" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack">
      <text>←</text>
    </view>
    <view class="nav-title">分享赚钱</view>
  </view>

  <view class="link-card">
    <view class="card-title">你的专属推广链接</view>
    <view class="card-desc">好友通过你的链接支付后你将获得30%返佣，且每单最低¥2</view>
    <view class="qr-wrapper">
      <view class="qr-placeholder">
        <text class="qr-icon">🔗</text>
      </view>
      <view class="qr-tip">长按或点击分享给微信好友</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats-card">
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-label">累计收益</view>
      <view class="stat-value">{{totalMoney}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-income">{{todayIncome}}</view>
      <view class="stat-unit">元/人</view>
      <view class="stat-sub">今日推广 {{todayCount}} 人</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-income">{{withdrawMoney}}</view>
      <view class="stat-unit">元</view>
      <view class="stat-sub">可提现</view>
      <view class="withdraw-btn-group">
        <view class="withdraw-btn" bindtap="openWithdrawModal">
          <text>提现</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{transferAuthEffective}}" class="terminate-auth-btn" bindtap="terminateTransferAuth">
          <text>解除授权</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="rule-card">
    <view class="rule-title">返佣规则</view>
    <view class="rule-desc">
      <text>返佣金额按好友实际支付金额30%算，且每单最低¥2。随着阅读人数不断增多，价格也会逐步上涨，最高达20元，你每单最高能获得6元</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="share-action" open-type="share">
    <text>立即分享给好友</text>
  </button>

  <!-- 授权引导弹窗 -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showAuthGuideModal}}" bindtap="closeAuthGuideModal"></view>
  <view class="auth-guide-modal" wx:if="{{showAuthGuideModal}}">
    <view class="auth-guide-header">
      <text class="auth-guide-title">免确认收款授权</text>
    </view>
    <view class="auth-guide-body">
      <view class="auth-guide-icon">
        <text>🔐</text>
      </view>
      <view class="auth-guide-desc">
        <text>授权免确认收款后，后续每次提现金额将直接到账微信零钱，无需手动确认。

一次授权长期有效，直至您在微信钱包主动关闭。

若不授权，每次提现需在微信服务通知中手动确认收款。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="auth-guide-footer">
      <view class="auth-guide-cancel" bindtap="closeAuthGuideModal">
        <text>稍后再说</text>
      </view>
      <view class="auth-guide-confirm" bindtap="goAuthorize">
        <text>去授权</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 提现弹窗 -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showWithdrawModal}}" bindtap="closeWithdrawModal"></view>
  <view class="withdraw-modal" wx:if="{{showWithdrawModal}}">
    <view class="withdraw-modal-header">
      <text class="withdraw-modal-title">申请提现</text>
    </view>
    <view class="withdraw-modal-body">
      <view class="withdraw-modal-notice">
        <text>单笔大于500元或当日累计达1000元需审核，审核后3天内到账。每小时只能提现一次。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="withdraw-input-row">
        <text class="withdraw-input-label">提现金额</text>
        <view class="withdraw-input-wrapper">
          <text class="withdraw-input-currency">¥</text>
          <input class="withdraw-input" type="digit" placeholder="最低 0.1 元" value="{{withdrawInput}}" bindinput="onWithdrawInput" />
        </view>
        <text class="withdraw-input-hint">最多可提现 ¥{{withdrawMoney}} · 最低 ¥0.1</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="withdraw-modal-footer">
      <view class="withdraw-modal-cancel" bindtap="closeWithdrawModal">
        <text>取消</text>
      </view>
      <view class="withdraw-modal-confirm" bindtap="confirmWithdraw">
        <text>确定</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>